{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What happens to an old house when its owner dies or vanishes under mysterious circumstances? Usually, the house is left abandoned. And when something is abandoned, it draws in all kinds of people looking to claim things that seemingly have no owner. But do these things truly belong to no one</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you become one of those people looking to profit from someone else\u2019s misfortune by selling a few intriguing items that are said to be hidden inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BARABIZNA</strong> is a short, spine-chilling horror game set in a creepy old house<strong>.\u00a0</strong>Your mission: find and collect all the hidden items before it's too late. But beware... you're not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run offers a different set of items to collect. Find them all and escape with your car to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/notes.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful with your battery\u2014you only have 15 minutes of power. Once it\u2019s gone, you\u2019ll be alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/battery.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item you collect makes the game more difficult, turning the search for the last few items into a true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/sky.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457800?t=1751611884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457800?t=1751611884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/adc0166d6f4c03358c282cb42c9c491c9d7a74c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751611884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/adc0166d6f4c03358c282cb42c9c491c9d7a74c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751611884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What happens to an old house when its owner dies or vanishes under mysterious circumstances? Usually, the house is left abandoned. And when something is abandoned, it draws in all kinds of people looking to claim things that seemingly have no owner. But do these things truly belong to no one</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you become one of those people looking to profit from someone else\u2019s misfortune by selling a few intriguing items that are said to be hidden inside the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BARABIZNA</strong> is a short, spine-chilling horror game set in a creepy old house<strong>.\u00a0</strong>Your mission: find and collect all the hidden items before it's too late. But beware... you're not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run offers a different set of items to collect. Find them all and escape with your car to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/notes.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful with your battery\u2014you only have 15 minutes of power. Once it\u2019s gone, you\u2019ll be alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/battery.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item you collect makes the game more difficult, turning the search for the last few items into a true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/extras/sky.gif?t=1751611884\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CepSoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457800/fb6bfef37859112a91a6735160ceaec51bf02b38/header.jpg?t=1751611884","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257087972,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087972/movie480.mp4?t=1751394154","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087972/movie_max.mp4?t=1751394154"},"name":"BARABIZNA - Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257087972/2bebe0410b8c669a50d0be4d95075d6cb0dc6434/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751394154","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087972/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751394154","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087972/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751394154"}}],"name":"BARABIZNA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</